.TH UH7000D 1 "July 2026" "tascam-uh7000-linux" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
uh7000d \- per-user D-Bus control service for the TASCAM UH-7000
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B uh7000d
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B uh7000d
owns the session-bus name
.B io.github.carlodevil.UH7000.Control1
and exposes typed status, read-only diagnostics, and the verified clock-source
transaction used by
.BR uh7000ctl (1)
and
.BR uh7000-panel (1).
.PP
The service is installed as the enabled per-user systemd unit
.BR uh7000d.service .
It starts on login and can also be activated through its D-Bus service file.
All mixer, effects, and routing controls without verified capture, readback,
and rollback evidence remain unavailable.
.SH SERVICE MANAGEMENT
.nf
systemctl --user status uh7000d.service
systemctl --user restart uh7000d.service
.fi
.SH SAFETY
The service rejects clock-source changes while configuration-1 analog playback
is active. It does not issue experimental vendor writes.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR uh7000ctl (1),
.BR uh7000-panel (1),
.BR uh7000-pipewire (1)
